  audit.types.json-finite-input-extensions,jq-manual/types-and-values.md,18,prose-boundary,"[type, .]","01\n+1\n.1\n1.",new,"Pinned jq emits [\"number\",1], [\"number\",1], [\"number\",0.1], and [\"number\",1] for these finite input spellings. This records the non-canonical numeric-input contract as a dated parser-boundary witness.",manual.audit.types.json-finite-input-extensions
  streaming.malformed-missing-separator,jq-manual/streaming.md,24,prose-boundary,.,"[1 2]",new,"Pinned jq --stream-errors emits the missing-separator error with path [0] and no leaf result.",manual.audit.streaming.malformed-missing-separator-stream-error
  streaming.malformed-trailing-comma,jq-manual/streaming.md,24,prose-boundary,.,"{\"a\":1,}",new,"Pinned jq --stream-errors emits the object leaf [\"a\",1] and then an error with null path.",manual.audit.streaming.malformed-trailing-comma-stream-error
  streaming.malformed-eof-array,jq-manual/streaming.md,24,prose-boundary,.,"[",new,"Pinned jq --stream-errors emits an unfinished-term error with path [0] at EOF.",manual.audit.streaming.malformed-eof-array-stream-error
  streaming.malformed-eof-object,jq-manual/streaming.md,24,prose-boundary,.,"{",new,"Pinned jq --stream-errors emits an unfinished-term error with null path at EOF.",manual.audit.streaming.malformed-eof-object-stream-error
  streaming.malformed-eof-string,jq-manual/streaming.md,24,prose-boundary,.,"\"abc",new,"Pinned jq --stream-errors emits an unfinished-string error with empty path at EOF.",manual.audit.streaming.malformed-eof-string-stream-error
  streaming.malformed-plain-partial-output,jq-manual/streaming.md,24,prose-boundary,.,"1\n{\"a\":",new,"Pinned jq plain input emits the prior root 1 before reporting the unfinished next object.",manual.audit.streaming.malformed-plain-partial-output
  audit.types.json-nonfinite-adjacent-values,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,740,prose-boundary,".","NaN{}\nNaN[]\nNaN\"x\"\n",new,"Pinned jq separates the adjacent values and emits null, {}, null, [], null, and \"x\"; the witness records token-boundary behavior without treating NaN text inside a string as a number.",manual.audit.types.json-nonfinite-adjacent-values
  audit.types.json-lone-low-surrogate,jq-manual/types-and-values.md,18,prose-boundary,"[type, .]","\"\\uDC00\"",new,"Pinned jq emits [\"string\",\"�\"] for a lone low-surrogate escape. This is an observed Unicode parser boundary, not an accepted disparity.",manual.audit.types.json-lone-low-surrogate
  audit.types.tonumber-nonfinite-and-relaxed-accepted,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,692,prose-boundary,"map(tonumber | {type: type, isnan: isnan, isinfinite: isinfinite})","[\"NaN\",\"Infinity\",\"sNaN\",\"+01.200\",\"1.\"]",new,"Pinned jq accepts these non-finite and relaxed numeric spellings through tonumber; predicates preserve typed NaN and Infinity distinctions while finite spellings remain numbers.",manual.audit.types.tonumber-nonfinite-and-relaxed-accepted
  audit.types.tonumber-invalid-whitespace,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,692,prose-boundary,tonumber,"\" 1 \"",new,"Pinned jq rejects surrounding whitespace rather than trimming a tonumber input.",manual.audit.types.tonumber-invalid-whitespace
  audit.types.tonumber-invalid-array,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,692,prose-boundary,tonumber,"[1]",new,"Pinned jq rejects an array passed to tonumber; this records the input-type boundary.",manual.audit.types.tonumber-invalid-array
  audit.types.tonumber-invalid-null,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,692,prose-boundary,tonumber,"null",new,"Pinned jq rejects null passed to tonumber; this records the input-type boundary.",manual.audit.types.tonumber-invalid-null
  audit.types.tonumber-invalid-trailing,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,692,prose-boundary,tonumber,"\"1 2\"",new,"Pinned jq rejects numeric text with a trailing token rather than accepting a prefix.",manual.audit.types.tonumber-invalid-trailing
  audit.types.tonumber-invalid-hex,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,692,prose-boundary,tonumber,"\"0x10\"",new,"Pinned jq rejects hexadecimal text passed to tonumber.",manual.audit.types.tonumber-invalid-hex
  audit.types.nonfinite-json-predicates,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,740,prose-boundary,"[type, isnan, isinfinite]","NaN\nnan\nNAN\n+NaN\n-NaN\nsNaN\n+sNaN\n-sNaN\nInfinity\ninfinity\nINFINITY\niNfInItY\nInf\ninf\n+Inf\n-Inf\n+Infinity\n+infinity\n-Infinity\n-infinity\n-iNfInItY\n",new,"Pinned jq emits [\"number\",true,false] for each NaN spelling and [\"number\",false,true] for each Infinity spelling; the witness records accepted jq non-finite token spellings and typed predicates without an approval exception.",manual.audit.types.nonfinite-json-predicates
  audit.types.nonfinite-json-nested,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,740,prose-boundary,"{nonfinite: [.values[] | {type: type, isnan: isnan, isinfinite: isinfinite}], quoted: .quoted}","{\"values\":[NaN,Infinity,-Infinity],\"quoted\":[\"NaN\",\"Infinity\"]}",new,"Pinned jq emits typed predicates for the nested non-finite numbers and preserves quoted \"NaN\" and \"Infinity\" strings; this is the nested-value contract witness.",manual.audit.types.nonfinite-json-nested
  audit.types.nonfinite-fromjson-predicates,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,1328,prose-boundary,"map(fromjson | {type: type, isnan: isnan, isinfinite: isinfinite})","[\"NaN\",\"nan\",\"sNaN\",\"+sNaN\",\"-sNaN\",\"Infinity\",\"infinity\",\"Inf\",\"inf\",\"+Inf\",\"-Inf\",\"+Infinity\",\"-Infinity\"]",new,"Pinned jq parses each string as a number and emits the corresponding true isnan or isinfinite predicate; this records the fromjson non-finite spelling contract.",manual.audit.types.nonfinite-fromjson-predicates
  audit.types.nonfinite-fromjson-quoted-safety,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,1328,prose-boundary,"map(fromjson)","[\"\\\"NaN\\\"\",\"\\\"Infinity\\\"\"]",new,"Pinned jq emits [\"NaN\",\"Infinity\"] and preserves these quoted-string values; the case prevents parser matching from inspecting string contents.",manual.audit.types.nonfinite-fromjson-quoted-safety
  audit.types.nonfinite-json-partial-stream,jq-manual/invoking-jq.md,102,prose-boundary,".","1\nNaN",new,"Pinned jq and the shared parser accept the valid non-finite token after the prior stream value; this witness records partial-stream continuation, not an invalid-input failure.",manual.audit.types.nonfinite-json-partial-stream
  audit.types.nonfinite-json-nested-projection,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,740,prose-boundary,".","[1,NaN]",new,"Pinned jq emits [1,null] while retaining the nested number as a typed non-finite value; this records the projection contract and is not an unresolved rejection claim.",manual.audit.types.nonfinite-json-nested-projection
  audit.types.nonfinite-json-invalid-suffix,jq-manual/invoking-jq.md,102,prose-boundary,".","1\nNaNfoo",new,"Pinned jq emits the prior 1 and then reports the malformed suffix; this witness distinguishes a valid non-finite token from a token with an invalid trailing word.",manual.audit.types.nonfinite-json-invalid-suffix
  audit.types.nonfinite-fromjson-invalid-suffix,jq-manual/builtin-operators-and-functions.md,1328,prose-boundary,"map(fromjson)","[\"NaNfoo\"]",new,"Pinned jq reports a catchable fromjson parse error for NaNfoo; this is a malformed-suffix contract, not a claim about valid NaN input.",manual.audit.types.nonfinite-fromjson-invalid-suffix
  audit.types.json-lone-high-surrogate,jq-manual/types-and-values.md,18,prose-boundary,"[type, .]","\"\\uD800\"",new,"Pinned jq rejects a lone high-surrogate escape as malformed JSON; this is a Unicode parser negative witness.",manual.audit.types.json-lone-high-surrogate
